    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><br>In this game you control a Caution sign, who lived happily doing its job day after day, until one day it was kidnapped, that's when it swore revenge.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/a25fd479ce3921a8417673ec410adf23.poster.avif?t=1688060578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/a25fd479ce3921a8417673ec410adf23.webm?t=1688060578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>This Garbageman became a villain from the moment he messed with the wrong sign, now he will bear the consequences of his actions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/Garbageman.gif?t=1688060578\" /></div><br><br><br>To carry out your revenge, you need to spread garbage throughout the city. All this, as fast as you can. Can you do it?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/2123be7259d7215469bb4b4c719a59ae.poster.avif?t=1688060578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/2123be7259d7215469bb4b4c719a59ae.webm?t=1688060578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/2123be7259d7215469bb4b4c719a59ae.mp4?t=1688060578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>\u2022 30 levels in 3 scenarios.<br>\u2022 1 hidden level for each scenario, for a total of 3 hidden levels.<br>\u2022 1 secret level hidden somewhere in the game.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><br>In this game you control a Caution sign, who lived happily doing its job day after day, until one day it was kidnapped, that's when it swore revenge.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/a25fd479ce3921a8417673ec410adf23.poster.avif?t=1688060578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/a25fd479ce3921a8417673ec410adf23.webm?t=1688060578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br>This Garbageman became a villain from the moment he messed with the wrong sign, now he will bear the consequences of his actions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/Garbageman.gif?t=1688060578\" /></div><br><br><br>To carry out your revenge, you need to spread garbage throughout the city. All this, as fast as you can. Can you do it?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/2123be7259d7215469bb4b4c719a59ae.poster.avif?t=1688060578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/2123be7259d7215469bb4b4c719a59ae.webm?t=1688060578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938030/extras/2123be7259d7215469bb4b4c719a59ae.mp4?t=1688060578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br>\u2022 30 levels in 3 scenarios.<br>\u2022 1 hidden level for each scenario, for a total of 3 hidden levels.<br>\u2022 1 secret level hidden somewhere in the game.",
